723
00:51:13,154 --> 00:51:15,030
Nothing . Never mind .

724
00:51:15,156 --> 00:51:17,282
No , no . Don 't say that . What is it ?

725
00:51:17,408 --> 00:51:19,660
Nothing .

726
00:51:19,786 --> 00:51:22,287
Look , honey , I know I 've been preoccupied ...

727
00:51:22,413 --> 00:51:24,414
with the part and all , but it is important .

728
00:51:24,540 --> 00:51:26,667
That doesn 't mean I don 't love you .

729
00:51:33,925 --> 00:51:36,176
# # [ Piano : " Für Elise " ]

730
00:51:41,307 --> 00:51:43,225
It was due on Friday .

731
00:51:45,228 --> 00:51:47,187
- It was ? - Mm-hmm .

732
00:51:48,231 --> 00:51:50,857
- It 'll probably come tonight or tomorrow . - Wanna bet ?

733
00:51:50,984 --> 00:51:52,442
- Yeah . - A quarter .

734
00:51:52,568 --> 00:51:54,319
- Okay . - You 're gonna lose .

735
00:51:54,445 --> 00:51:56,822
Shut up , will ya ? You 're getting me all jumpy .

736
00:51:56,948 --> 00:51:59,116
It 's only been two days .

737
00:51:59,242 --> 00:52:01,034
When will I know ?

738
00:52:01,160 --> 00:52:03,287
I 'll call you just as soon as I get the results .

739
00:52:03,413 --> 00:52:07,082
I like to do a general examination just to know something more .

740
00:52:08,918 --> 00:52:11,461
It was Elise Dunstan who recommended you to me , Doctor .

741
00:52:11,587 --> 00:52:13,714
- Oh , yes . How is she ? - She 's fine .

742
00:52:13,881 --> 00:52:16,341
And the boys are great . Did you deliver all of them ?

743
00:52:16,467 --> 00:52:19,386
No , just the last . Universal hemoglobin .

744
00:52:19,554 --> 00:52:21,263
Yes , Doctor .

745
00:52:27,979 --> 00:52:30,063
[ Water Running ]

746
00:52:34,235 --> 00:52:36,903
- We went to see The Fantasticks . - Oh , did you ?

747
00:52:37,030 --> 00:52:38,697
- Mm . - Did you enjoy it ?

748
00:52:38,823 --> 00:52:40,741
- Yeah . - Good .

749
00:52:43,911 --> 00:52:45,871
[ Ringing ]

750
00:52:47,081 --> 00:52:48,832
- Hello ? - [ Doctor ] Mrs. Woodhouse ?

751
00:52:48,958 --> 00:52:51,460
- Dr. Hill ? - Congratulations .

752
00:52:51,586 --> 00:52:53,545
- Really ? - Really .

753
00:52:55,715 --> 00:52:57,299
Are you there ?

754
00:52:57,425 --> 00:52:59,926
Uh , yes . Um , what happens now ?

755
00:53:00,053 --> 00:53:02,054
Very little . You come see me next month ...

756
00:53:02,180 --> 00:53:04,264
and you get those Natalin pills ... one a day .

757
00:53:04,390 --> 00:53:07,976
- I 'll mail you forms for the hospital . - Uh , when will it be ?

758
00:53:08,102 --> 00:53:11,355
Uh , it works out to be June 28 .

759
00:53:11,481 --> 00:53:13,482
- That sounds so far away . - It is .

760
00:53:13,608 --> 00:53:15,525
- Yeah . - Oh , one more thing , Mrs. Woodhouse .

761
00:53:15,651 --> 00:53:19,488
- We 'd like another blood sample . - Oh , yes , of course .

762
00:53:19,614 --> 00:53:22,324
- What for ? - Uh , the nurse didn 't take enough .

763
00:53:22,450 --> 00:53:26,161
- So would you drop by and see her ? - But I-I am pregnant , aren 't I ?

764
00:53:26,287 --> 00:53:29,289
Oh , yes . It 's just for blood sugar and so forth .

765
00:53:29,415 --> 00:53:31,958
Nothing to be concerned about . You 're pregnant . Don 't worry .

766
00:53:32,085 --> 00:53:34,461
All right . Well , I 'll come in on Monday .

767
00:53:34,629 --> 00:53:36,880
- All right . Now , don 't forget the pills . - No , I won 't .

768
00:53:37,006 --> 00:53:39,257
- Good-bye , Mrs. Woodhouse . - Good-bye , Dr. Hill .

769
00:53:41,302 --> 00:53:42,928
Blood sugar ?

770
00:53:59,445 --> 00:54:01,196
What 's that ?

771
00:54:03,741 --> 00:54:07,285
Oh ! That 's great ! That 's just great !

772
00:54:07,412 --> 00:54:10,122
- Father . - Ah , Mother .

773
00:54:11,499 --> 00:54:13,917
- [ Whistles ] - Guy ... Guy , listen .

774
00:54:14,043 --> 00:54:16,837
Let 's , uh , make this a new beginning , okay ?

775
00:54:17,004 --> 00:54:19,047
A new openness and talking to each other ...

776
00:54:19,173 --> 00:54:21,174
because we haven 't been open .

777
00:54:21,342 --> 00:54:24,719
It 's true . I 've been so goddamned self-centered .

778
00:54:24,846 --> 00:54:26,805
That 's what the whole trouble is .

779
00:54:26,931 --> 00:54:29,141
And you know I love you , don 't you , Ro ? I do .

780
00:54:29,267 --> 00:54:32,352
- I swear to God I 'm gonna be as open ... - It 's my fault as much as yours .

781
00:54:32,520 --> 00:54:34,521
No , bull ! It 's mine . Now , you bear with me ...

782
00:54:34,647 --> 00:54:36,565
and I 'm gonna try and do better , you hear ?

783
00:54:36,691 --> 00:54:38,525
Oh , Guy !

784
00:54:44,699 --> 00:54:46,658
[ Chuckling ]

785
00:54:47,702 --> 00:54:50,036
What ?

786
00:54:50,204 --> 00:54:53,373
Fine way for parents to be carrying on .

787
00:54:53,499 --> 00:54:56,460
Hey , you know what I 'd love to do ?

788
00:54:56,586 --> 00:54:59,963
- What ? - Tell Minnie and Roman .

789
00:55:00,089 --> 00:55:02,924
Oh , I know , I know . It 's , uh ...

790
00:55:03,050 --> 00:55:05,427
it 's , uh , supposed to be a deep , dark secret ...

791
00:55:05,553 --> 00:55:09,014
but I 've already told them that we were trying .

792
00:55:09,140 --> 00:55:11,725
They were so pleased .

793
00:55:11,851 --> 00:55:13,727
Tell them .

794
00:55:13,853 --> 00:55:15,562
- Back in two minutes ? - Mm-hmm .

795
00:55:26,657 --> 00:55:28,575
You 're pregnant .

796
00:55:31,078 --> 00:55:32,704
Another blood sample .

797
00:55:32,830 --> 00:55:37,292
- # Ta-da # - Now , that 's what I call good news !

798
00:55:37,418 --> 00:55:40,170
Ah , honey , congratulations !

799
00:55:40,296 --> 00:55:42,964
- Thank you . - Our best wishes , Rosemary .

800
00:55:43,090 --> 00:55:45,800
- Thank you very much . - We are more pleased than we can say .

801
00:55:45,927 --> 00:55:49,262
We didn 't have any champagne on hand , but this will do just as nicely .

802
00:55:49,430 --> 00:55:52,474
- When are you due , dear ? - June 28 .

803
00:55:52,600 --> 00:55:55,268
Oh , it 's gonna be so exciting . Listen , dear , you got a good doctor ?

804
00:55:55,436 --> 00:55:57,062
Oh , yes , a very good one .

805
00:55:57,188 --> 00:55:59,481
One of the top obstetricians is a dear friend of ours .

806
00:55:59,607 --> 00:56:02,484
Abe Sapirstein . Delivers all the society babies .

807
00:56:02,610 --> 00:56:05,862
Abe Sapirstein ? One of the finest obstetricians in the country .

808
00:56:05,988 --> 00:56:07,948
Wasn 't he on Open End a couple of years ago ?

809
00:56:08,074 --> 00:56:09,741
That 's right .

810
00:56:09,867 --> 00:56:12,077
- Ro ? - Uh ...

811
00:56:12,203 --> 00:56:14,454
- Well , what about Dr. Hill ? - Don 't worry about Hill .

812
00:56:14,622 --> 00:56:16,540
I 'll tell him something . You know me .

813
00:56:16,666 --> 00:56:19,960
Listen , I won 't let you go to no Dr. Hill nobody ever heard of .

814
00:56:20,086 --> 00:56:22,254
The best is what you 're gonna have , young lady .

815
00:56:22,380 --> 00:56:25,131
- Where 's your telephone , huh ? - It 's in the bedroom .

816
00:56:25,258 --> 00:56:27,968
He 's a brilliant man . Very sensitive .

817
00:56:28,094 --> 00:56:31,263
- Ro , sit down , sit down ! - No , I 'm fine .

818
00:56:31,389 --> 00:56:33,848
Abe ? Minnie . Fine .

819
00:56:33,975 --> 00:56:37,435
Listen , Abe , a dear friend of ours just found out today she 's pregnant .

820
00:56:37,562 --> 00:56:40,313
Yeah , isn 't it ? I 'm in her apartment right now .

821
00:56:40,439 --> 00:56:42,440
We told her you 'd be glad to take care of her .

822
00:56:42,567 --> 00:56:45,986
You wouldn 't charge her none of your fancy society prices , neither .

823
00:56:46,153 --> 00:56:49,197
Uh-huh . Just wait a minute . Rosemary , tomorrow morning at 11 : 00 ?

824
00:56:49,323 --> 00:56:52,617
- All right . - Yeah , 11 : 00 's fine , Abe .

825
00:56:52,743 --> 00:56:55,453
Uh-huh . Yeah , well , you too .

826
00:56:55,580 --> 00:56:57,664
No . No , no , no . Not at all .

827
00:56:57,790 --> 00:57:00,625
All right . Well , let 's hope so . Good-bye .

828
00:57:00,751 --> 00:57:04,462
- Well , there you are . - Hey , thanks a million , Minnie .

829
00:57:04,589 --> 00:57:06,506
Yes , I don 't know how to thank you , both of you .

830
00:57:06,632 --> 00:57:08,842
Just have a fine , healthy baby , that 's all .

831
00:57:08,968 --> 00:57:12,345
[ Gasps ] My , I can 't wait to tell Laura-Louise .

832
00:57:12,471 --> 00:57:14,347
Oh , uh ...

833
00:57:14,473 --> 00:57:16,933
please don 't tell anyone else , not right away .

834
00:57:17,059 --> 00:57:19,686
No , she 's right . There 's plenty of time .

835
00:57:19,812 --> 00:57:22,439
Now , to a fine , healthy baby .

836
00:57:22,565 --> 00:57:24,441
- Hear , hear ! - Hear !

837
00:57:26,360 --> 00:57:27,819
Andy ?

838
00:57:30,197 --> 00:57:31,740
Or Susan ?

839
00:57:33,242 --> 00:57:34,993
Susan !

840
00:57:36,495 --> 00:57:39,039
[ Women Chattering ]

841
00:57:41,125 --> 00:57:43,627
[ Minnie Laughing ]

842
00:57:44,378 --> 00:57:46,338
[ Siren Wailing ]

843
00:57:56,515 --> 00:57:58,475
[ Mumbling ]

844
00:58:20,873 --> 00:58:22,749
Please don 't read books .

845
00:58:22,875 --> 00:58:27,087
No pregnancy was ever exactly like the ones described in the books .

846
00:58:27,213 --> 00:58:29,923
And don 't listen to your friends either .

847
00:58:30,091 --> 00:58:33,218
No two pregnancies are ever alike .

848
00:58:33,344 --> 00:58:36,221
- Dr. Hill prescribed vitamin pills . - No pills .

849
00:58:36,347 --> 00:58:39,641
Minnie Castevet has a herbarium .

850
00:58:39,767 --> 00:58:43,520
I 'm gonna have her make a daily drink for you that 'll be fresher , safer ...

851
00:58:43,646 --> 00:58:46,147
and more vitamin-rich than any pills on the market .

852
00:58:47,775 --> 00:58:50,402
Any questions you have , call me night or day .

853
00:58:50,528 --> 00:58:53,405
Call me , not your Aunt Fanny . That 's what I 'm here for .

854
00:58:53,531 --> 00:58:55,907
- Here . - What 's in it ?

855
00:58:56,033 --> 00:58:58,910
Snips and snails and puppy dogs ' tails .

856
00:58:59,036 --> 00:59:01,121
That 's fine , but what if we want a girl ?

857
00:59:01,288 --> 00:59:02,956
Do you ?

858
00:59:03,082 --> 00:59:07,043
- It 'd be nice if the first one were a boy . - Well , there you are .

859
00:59:10,089 --> 00:59:14,217
- No , really , what is in it ? - A raw egg , gelatin , herbs ...

860
00:59:14,343 --> 00:59:16,136
Tannis root ?

861
00:59:16,262 --> 00:59:19,097
Some of that , along with some other things .

862
00:59:19,223 --> 00:59:21,141
Don 't be so violent , Harry .

863
00:59:21,267 --> 00:59:24,102
If you want to be stupid , be nonviolent stupid .

864
00:59:24,228 --> 00:59:28,106
I 'm in love with no one , especially not your fat wife .

865
00:59:28,232 --> 00:59:30,275
I 'm a hopeless cripple ...

866
00:59:31,986 --> 00:59:33,486
What 's that ?

867
00:59:34,947 --> 00:59:37,741
I 've been to Vidal Sassoon .

868
00:59:37,867 --> 00:59:39,909
Don 't tell me you paid for that .

869
00:59:41,245 --> 00:59:44,038
Guy , I have a pain .

870
00:59:44,165 --> 00:59:46,666
- Where ? - In here .

871
00:59:46,792 --> 00:59:51,004
- Just now ? - Since Monday . A sharp pain .

872
00:59:51,172 --> 00:59:53,631
- Did you see Sapirstein ? - I 'm seeing him on Wednesday .

873
00:59:53,758 --> 00:59:56,342
This is ridiculous ! Why didn 't you see Sapirstein ?

874
00:59:56,469 --> 01:00:00,346
- I mean , why didn 't you say anything ? - I see him Wednesday , regular .

875
01:00:00,473 --> 01:00:03,057
An entirely natural expansion of the pelvis .

876
01:00:03,184 --> 01:00:05,059
You can fight it with ordinary aspirin .

877
01:00:05,186 --> 01:00:07,729
I was afraid it might be an ectopic pregnancy .

878
01:00:07,855 --> 01:00:11,357
" Ectopic " ? I thought you weren 't gonna read books , Rosemary .

879
01:00:11,484 --> 01:00:14,569
- It was staring at me in the drugstore . - And all it did was worry you .

880
01:00:14,695 --> 01:00:16,571
Will you go home and throw it away , please ?

881
01:00:16,697 --> 01:00:19,866
- I will . I promise . - The pains will be gone in two days .

882
01:00:19,992 --> 01:00:21,868
Ectopic pregnancy !

883
01:01:05,913 --> 01:01:07,580
I look awful .

884
01:01:08,749 --> 01:01:11,709
What are you talking about ? You look great .

885
01:01:11,836 --> 01:01:14,712
It 's that haircut that looks awful .

886
01:01:14,839 --> 01:01:18,675
If you want the truth , honey , that 's the worst mistake you ever made .

887
01:01:53,419 --> 01:01:55,044
My God !

888
01:01:55,170 --> 01:01:57,630
It 's Vidal Sassoon . It 's very " in . "

889
01:01:57,756 --> 01:01:59,632
What 's wrong with you ?

890
01:01:59,758 --> 01:02:02,176
- Do I look that bad ? - Terrible !

891
01:02:02,303 --> 01:02:04,470
You 're not on one of those Zen diets , are you ?

892
01:02:04,638 --> 01:02:06,514
- No . - Then what is it ?

893
01:02:06,640 --> 01:02:08,600
Have you seen a doctor ?

894
01:02:08,726 --> 01:02:11,311
Hutch , I might as well tell you . I 'm pregnant .

895
01:02:11,437 --> 01:02:12,979
Oh , rubbish !

896
01:02:13,105 --> 01:02:15,899
Pregnant women gain weight , they don 't lose it .

897
01:02:16,025 --> 01:02:17,984
I don 't sleep well .

898
01:02:18,152 --> 01:02:20,653
I have stiff joints or something , so I get a pain .

899
01:02:20,779 --> 01:02:22,488
Nothing serious .

900
01:02:22,656 --> 01:02:26,075
Well , congratulations . You must be very happy .

901
01:02:26,201 --> 01:02:28,703
Oh , I am . We both are .

902
01:02:28,829 --> 01:02:32,373
- Who 's your obstetrician ? - Abraham Sapirstein .

903
01:02:32,499 --> 01:02:35,335
Oh ! He delivered two of my daughter 's babies .

904
01:02:35,502 --> 01:02:38,671
- He 's one of the best in the city . - When did you see him last ?

905
01:02:38,797 --> 01:02:41,382
- Um , yesterday . - And ?

906
01:02:41,508 --> 01:02:44,719
And he says it 's fairly common .

907
01:02:44,845 --> 01:02:47,513
How much weight have you lost ?

908
01:02:47,681 --> 01:02:49,682
About , uh , three pounds .

909
01:02:49,850 --> 01:02:52,685
Oh , nonsense . You 've lost far more than that .

910
01:02:52,853 --> 01:02:55,021
It 's perfectly normal to lose a little at first .

911
01:02:55,189 --> 01:02:57,231
Later on I 'll be gaining .

912
01:02:57,358 --> 01:02:59,025
Well ...

913
01:02:59,193 --> 01:03:02,070
we must assume Dr. Sapirstein knows whereof he speaks .

914
01:03:02,196 --> 01:03:04,530
He should . He charges enough .

915
01:03:04,698 --> 01:03:07,533
We 're getting bargain rates . Our neighbors are close friends of his .

916
01:03:07,701 --> 01:03:09,452
- [ Door Buzzer Sounds ] - I 'll go .

917
01:03:09,578 --> 01:03:12,372
No , no . Stay where you are . Hurts less when I move around .

918
01:03:15,459 --> 01:03:17,543
Oh , I was just talking about you .

919
01:03:17,670 --> 01:03:20,421
Favorably , I hope . Do you need anything from outside ?

920
01:03:20,547 --> 01:03:23,925
- No . Thank you for asking . - Is Guy home already ?

921
01:03:24,051 --> 01:03:26,719
- No , he won 't be home till 6 : 00 . - Oh .

922
01:03:26,887 --> 01:03:29,472
A friend of ours is here .

923
01:03:29,598 --> 01:03:31,557
Would you ... Would you like to meet him ?

924
01:03:31,725 --> 01:03:35,061
- Well , if I won 't be intruding . - No , no . Please come in .

925
01:03:46,407 --> 01:03:49,117
Hutch , this is Roman Castevet .

926
01:03:49,243 --> 01:03:51,119
- Edward Hutchins . - How do you do ?

927
01:03:51,245 --> 01:03:53,329
- How are you , sir ? - I was just telling Hutch ...

928
01:03:53,455 --> 01:03:55,707
it was you and Minnie who sent me to Dr. Sapirstein .

929
01:03:55,833 --> 01:03:58,001
So Rosemary has told you the good news ?

930
01:03:58,127 --> 01:04:00,920
- Yes , she has . - We must see she gets plenty of rest .

931
01:04:01,088 --> 01:04:03,089
I was a bit alarmed by her appearance .

932
01:04:03,257 --> 01:04:06,843
Well , she has lost some weight , but that 's quite normal for the early months .

933
01:04:06,969 --> 01:04:09,470
Later on , she 'll gain ... probably far too much .

934
01:04:09,596 --> 01:04:12,223
- So I gather . - Please sit down .

935
01:04:12,349 --> 01:04:16,144
Mrs. Castevet makes a vitamin drink for me every day from fresh herbs she grows .

936
01:04:16,270 --> 01:04:19,731
Yes , all according to Dr. Sapirstein 's directions , of course .

937
01:04:19,857 --> 01:04:23,860
He 's inclined to be suspicious of commercially prepared vitamin pills .

938
01:04:23,986 --> 01:04:26,279
Is he indeed ? Why , surely they 're manufactured ...

939
01:04:26,447 --> 01:04:28,364
under every imaginable safeguard .

940
01:04:28,490 --> 01:04:30,491
That 's quite true , but commercial pills ...

941
01:04:30,617 --> 01:04:32,618
can sit for months on a druggist 's shelf ...

942
01:04:32,786 --> 01:04:35,079
and lose a great deal of their original potency .

943
01:04:35,205 --> 01:04:36,541
I hadn 't thought of that .

944
01:04:36,542 --> 01:04:39,459
I like the idea of having everything fresh and natural .

945
01:04:39,626 --> 01:04:42,628
I 'll bet expectant mothers chewed bits of tannis root ...

946
01:04:42,796 --> 01:04:44,881
when nobody 'd even heard of vitamin pills .

947
01:04:45,007 --> 01:04:48,342
- Tannis root ? - It 's one of the herbs she puts in the drink .

948
01:04:48,469 --> 01:04:50,470
Or is it an herb ? Can a root be an herb ?

949
01:04:50,637 --> 01:04:53,014
You sure you don 't mean anise or orris root ?

950
01:04:53,140 --> 01:04:55,600
- No , tannis . - Hmm .

951
01:04:56,685 --> 01:04:58,394
Look .

952
01:04:59,980 --> 01:05:01,898
It 's good luck too .

953
01:05:02,649 --> 01:05:04,609
[ Exclaims ]

954
01:05:06,403 --> 01:05:08,946
It doesn 't look like root matter .

955
01:05:09,073 --> 01:05:11,824
More like mold or fungus of some kind .

956
01:05:13,494 --> 01:05:16,621
- Is it ever called by any other name ? - Not to my knowledge , no .

957
01:05:16,747 --> 01:05:18,498
Hmm .

958
01:05:18,624 --> 01:05:21,918
" Tannis " ... I must look it up in the encyclopedia .

959
01:05:22,044 --> 01:05:24,378
What a pretty holder or charm or whatever it is .

960
01:05:24,505 --> 01:05:26,464
The Castevets gave it to me .

961
01:05:26,590 --> 01:05:30,468
You and your wife seem to be taking better care of Rosemary than her own parents .

962
01:05:30,594 --> 01:05:32,762
We 're very fond of her , and of Guy too .

963
