989
01:06:47,921 --> 01:06:50,131
Guy , did you ever notice he has pierced ears ?

990
01:06:50,257 --> 01:06:52,300
- You 're kidding . - No , I 'm not . I saw .

991
01:06:52,426 --> 01:06:55,178
