997
01:07:15,866 --> 01:07:18,951
Andrew or Douglas if it 's a boy . Melinda or Sarah if it 's a girl .

998
01:07:19,077 --> 01:07:20,953
" Sarah " ? What happened to " Susan " ?

999
01:07:21,079 --> 01:07:23,372
Say , is there another of these around ?

1000
01:07:23,498 --> 01:07:25,208
Oh .

1001
01:07:29,213 --> 01:07:31,380
- I don 't see it , Hutch . - No , it 's not here .

1002
01:07:31,506 --> 01:07:34,383
Hmm . Oh , probably left at the City Center .

1003
01:07:34,509 --> 01:07:37,637
I 'll stop back there . Let 's really have that dinner , shall we ?

1004
01:07:37,763 --> 01:07:39,472
- Definitely . - Next week .

1005
01:07:39,640 --> 01:07:41,140
- Good-bye . - Good-bye .

1006
01:07:41,266 --> 01:07:43,142
